<title>USA: Bay Pond group cuts Horizon Bancorp stake.</title>
<headline>Bay Pond group cuts Horizon Bancorp stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Bay Pond Partners L.P. said Monday it reduced its stake in Horizon Bancorp to 4.54 percent or 63,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 7,000 shares on August 2 for $15.75 a share.</p>
<p>The group continues to hold its remaining stake for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
